    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d305">

                <pb facs="0280" n="268" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg268"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">741.9111/30: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-01-27T19:00:00+01:00">January 27, 1942—7
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received January 27—1:50 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>386. Your 303, January 26, 9 p.m. The Embassy has informed the Foreign Office
                    today both orally and by formal note of the stipulations set forth in your
                    telegram regarding the Anglo-Soviet-Iranian treaty.</p>
                <p>The Foreign Office received a telegram from Tehran this morning stating that the
                    treaty passed its second reading yesterday and is to go into effect January
                        29.<anchor n="54" xml:id="d305-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d305-f1" n="54" xml:id="d305-f1-content">
                <p>For text of Treaty of Alliance between the United Kingdom, the Soviet Union, and
                    Iran, signed at Tehran, January 29, 1942, see Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, March 21, 1942, p. 249.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
